Richard Kennedy wrote:
> 
> My JVC mininote laptop has an inbuilt SiS modem
> 
> 00:01.6 Modem [0703]: Silicon Integrated Systems [SiS] AC'97 Modem Controller [1039:7013] (rev a0)
